-- ---------------------------------------------------------------- local invariants
-- an invariant of each node's own state that the node's view preserves (whatever it is
-- answered) holds in every reachable state: no other node and no choice of the adversary can
-- break it
VOk : {M St : Type} → (St → Type) → NView M St → Type
VOk {M} {St} P v = case v of v-halt → Unit; v-send to m s → P s; v-recv k → (r : Rcv M) → P (k r); v-now kn → (w : Word) → P (kn w); v-tau s → P s
